# <<< SH-6343 public-safe eval allowlist <<<

# Agent run telemetry is local scratch — never publish. These .jsonl files carry
# absolute /Users/... paths and are not part of a skill's public content (the
# privacy gate scans SKILL.md + audit-state/comprehension/application.json, not
# telemetry). Ignore repo-wide so a `git add -A` can never re-leak them (SKI-736).
**/agent-telemetry.jsonl
